// =============================================================
// Exercise 3 - Workbook tile: failed sign-ins over time
// =============================================================
// Goal: timechart of failed sign-ins per hour, broken down by result.
// Renders cleanly as a line/area chart in a workbook.
//
// Where to paste: Workbook > Add query > Run query > Visualization = Time chart
// =============================================================

SigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| where ResultType != 0
| summarize FailedAttempts = count()
    by bin(TimeGenerated, 1h), ResultDescription
| render timechart
